### Forum Reporting demo requests (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client)
### X-Demo-UserId is DEMO authentication only.

@reporting = http://localhost:5103
@account = http://localhost:5102
@posts = http://localhost:5101

### Posts stub: who wrote post-1?
GET {{posts}}/api/posts/post-1

### Report a post (repeat with reporter-1..5)
POST {{reporting}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-UserId: reporter-1

{ "postId": "post-1", "reason": "Harassment" }

### Duplicate: same reporter, different post by the same author -> 409
POST {{reporting}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-UserId: reporter-1

{ "postId": "post-2", "reason": "Spam" }

### Self-report -> 422 (post-11 belongs to reporter-1)
POST {{reporting}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-UserId: reporter-1

{ "postId": "post-11", "reason": "Spam" }

### Distinct-reporter count and block-request state (Reporting)
GET {{reporting}}/api/reports/users/target-1/summary
X-Demo-UserId: support-demo

### Account status (Account)
GET {{account}}/api/accounts/target-1/status
